        "date": "2013-09-12",
        "description": "Removed 'vrsPositionOfCgWrtWingLeadingEdge_X' input to better conform to convention; thus, moment coefficients are given about the moment reference center (35 % mean aero chord). This means moment transfers to the center of mass must be done externally to this routine. Also modified the embedded F-16 matlab script as it no longer matches, as it had the moment transfer calculations. Updated descriptions of coefficient outputs to state they are acting at or about the moment reference center.",
        "modification_id": "O"
